ss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" version=\"2.0\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>CoinDesk: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Crypto News and Price Data</title>\n    <link>https://www.coindesk.com/</link>\n    <atom:link rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss\"/>\n    <atom:link rel=\"hub\" href=\"true\"/>\n    <description>Leader in cryptocurrency, Bitcoin, Ethereum, XRP, blockchain, DeFi, digital finance and Web 3.0 news with analysis, video and live price updates.</description>\n    <lastBuildDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 10:42:31 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en-US</language>\n    <copyright>© 2026 CoinDesk, Inc.</copyright>\n    <generator>CoinDesk</generator>\n    <ttl>5</ttl>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <url>https://downloads.coindesk.com/arc/failsafe/feeds/coindesk-feed-logo.png</url>\n      <title>CoinDesk: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Crypto News and Price Data</title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/</link>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[HYPE funds attract millions as investors dump bitcoin and ether ETFs]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/hype-funds-attract-millions-as-investors-dump-bitcoin-and-ether-etfs</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/8e8af44b57d72fd522a98e20bbffce3f34b6ee48-1920x1080.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">91cbd387-6f02-4cca-997d-72ec08160258</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 10:28:47 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Investors turn to HYPE and XRP funds while dumping bitcoin and ether ETFs.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hyperliquid]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[XRP News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Hyperliquid is emerging as a challenger to traditional exchanges and prediction markets, says FalconX]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/hyperliquid-is-emerging-as-a-challenger-to-traditional-exchanges-and-prediction-markets-says-falconx</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/7abb923cd3f5036c351144b00a69fb04fe321e58-6000x4000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">43d82d50-9040-437e-b817-2324f5d00b6f</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 08:09:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[A new report shows Hyperliquid is rapidly expanding beyond crypto into pre-IPO markets, prediction contracts, and 24/7 asset trading, putting Wall Street giants on high alert.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hyperliquid]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin trades above $77,000 as oil's 5% slide pushes Asian equities higher]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/bitcoin-trades-above-usd77-000-as-oil-s-5-slide-pushes-asian-equities-higher</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/3df6f4ba6e8319031d4b0cfeff769be256ca23f1-2846x1076.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">8f362105-68f0-4833-99d8-a9540daa6f9b</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:11:57 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Oil’s 5% drop on potential Strait of Hormuz reopening boosted Asian equities and supported crypto sentiment.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin options are coming to Nasdaq. Here's what it means for you. ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/bitcoin-options-are-coming-to-nadaq-here-s-what-it-means-for-you</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/04f231dbc1b627628eb7b1afe3073540e1eb17e2-1690x751.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">c1d9d0d8-4569-4e24-b0cb-cfe1662532bd</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:56:43 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The new offering, pending CFTC approval, aims to democratize seamless crypto risk management ]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindes