 finalization between the United States of America, the Islamic Republic of Iran, and the various other Countries,\" wrote President Trump late Saturday afternoon.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Stephen Alpher</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Breaking News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin is ready to beat stocks and bonds again after underperformance against Wall Street]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/23/bitcoin-is-ready-to-beat-stocks-and-bonds-again-after-underperformance-against-wall-street</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/4f8f6d1e4c3c206e95b1ee4a8c8f73a1353d044a-3656x1928.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">005f72f4-d71b-4390-aa50-6fe124f4737d</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Former Credit Suisse global head of portfolio and Risk Dimensions CIO Mark Connors says bitcoin has broken out of its longest stretch of underperformance in history and is ready to beat stocks, bonds, and gold as inflation stubbornly sticks around.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto trader sees Hyperliquid, AI tokens leading next altcoin rally]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/23/crypto-trader-sees-hyperliquid-ai-tokens-leading-next-altcoin-rally</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/e7f712e4315b851a9891037df6c9d2989d66a087-1378x772.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <media:content url=\"/video/why-michael-van-de-poppe-sees-100-for-hype\" type=\"video/*\" medium=\"video\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">5ac274e0-cbc8-4ec0-a5c1-7250d937ea6b</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 14:19:18 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Hyperliquid’s surge and renewed interest in AI-focused crypto projects are signaling a broader return of risk appetite in altcoins, says Michael van de Poppe.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Media Network Interview]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hyperliquid]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Altcoins]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Clarity Act could spark a boom in crypto ‘yield-as-a-service’]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/23/clarity-act-could-spark-a-boom-in-crypto-yield-as-a-service</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/822b54f142ab14b2c15954a87529a4bed9d926aa-5107x3405.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">3a5de869-f65c-4d17-a5a8-8d8d3a12001c</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The bill’s restrictions on yield-bearing crypto products may push the industry away from passive \"hold-to-earn\" models and toward AI-driven, compliant yield infrastructure, according to STBL Chief Commercial Officer Joe Vollono.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Will Canny</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Clarity Act]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Exclusive]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[stablecoin yield]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Regulation]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[STBL]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin tanks to $74,300 as spot ETFs bleed $2.26 billion in two weeks]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/23/bitcoin-tanks-to-usd74-300-as-spot-etfs-bleed-usd2-26-billion-in-two-weeks</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/e2b250769dc24dc65d4b356ebe19b24e3646ea3c-2914x1089.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">4ce3da7e-2def-410c-8ff7-5ec263442413</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 10:19:40 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[U.S.-listed spot bitcoin exchange-traded funds have seen more than $2.26 billion in outflows over the past two weeks.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[F2Pool founder who controls 11% of bitcoin's hashrate to lead first SpaceX mission to Mars]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/22/f2pool-founder-who-controls-11-of-bitcoin-s-hashrate-to-lead-first-spacex-mission-to-mars</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/3b93544f6ae76fe08356e8f512cf1ce0aed958eb-4032x3024.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">1456bcb2-4a4b-41d6-980a-127d1cc8be63</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 19:47:09 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Chun Wang, the first Mission Commander for SpaceX’s first commercial spaceflight to Mars, is crucial for the future transport of millions of tons of cargo and a million citizens to the Red Planet.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin Mining]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[SpaceX]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Elon Musk]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Robinhood Crypto COO Tanya Denisova is leaving company amid revenue slowdown]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/22/robinhood-crypto-coo-tanya-denisova-is-leaving-company-amid-revenue-slowdown</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/cb0bf014fcfb96a3b856413652b97154bb22a97e-720x406.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">88267bac-5e7b-4f80-add8-94947fd45938</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 19:40:15 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Robinhood Crypto COO Tanya Denisova is leaving the firm after more than five years, as the trading platform navigates a sharp decline in crypto revenue and works to lessen its dependence on digital asset market cycles.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Will Canny</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Exclusive]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Robinhood]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Crypto Trading]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[SEC Commissioner Peirce counters views that crypto rule will foster synthetic tokens]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/news-analysis/2026/05/22/sec-commissioner-peirce-counters-views-that-crypto-rule-will-foster-synthetic-tokens</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/facaa2fb18c3e0eac299cf2f40a828bb6705036d-1920x1080.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">5f562811-ae89-46a9-933e-0ab4d8d234b7</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 18:20:32 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Hester Peirce, the commissioner behind the SEC's Crypto Task Force, made statements on the now-delayed proposal, perhaps tamping down mistaken beliefs.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Jesse Hamilton</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/news-analysis\"><![CDATA[News Analysis]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Tokenization]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Regulation]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Why Minnesota is empowering local banks to fight Wall Street for crypto revenue]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/22/why-minnesota-is-empowering-local-banks-to-fight-wall-street-for-crypto-revenue</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/271c1937e18b80730064c0aa2ca72aa439a3ec09-1212x865.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">942a874d-d6b7-45d6-baad-03ed0685a10d</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 17:53:41 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[A local banker told CoinDesk that in light of Wall Street’s aggressive push into the crypto industry, Minnesota's financial institutions could not afford to remain on the sidelines.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Custody]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Cryptocurrency]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[banks]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Tom Emmer brushes off law enforcement concerns over Clarity Act]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/22/tom-emmer-brushes-off-law-enforcement-concerns-over-clarity-act</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/c5dafeb7e4f60dedd2f71a7e7702bef2856f50c1-1920x1080.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <media:content url=\"/video/emmer-pushes-back-on-cftc-funding-give-regulators-less-authority\" type=\"video/*\" medium=\"video\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">0ae61452-9581-4862-a8be-619bc303364c</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 16:30:55 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[House Majority Whip Tom Emmer said concerns from law enforcement groups about crypto developer protections are being overstated.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Congress hits Polymarket and Kalshi with a massive insider trading probe]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/22/congress-probes-polymarket-and-kalshi-over-fears-government-employees-are-trading-on-secret-info</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/b25f92f41078a970ccce304a54e556d7b64a206c-1900x1268.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">1d2004c7-c9a3-4269-ae73-aa1df7185395</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 15:27:40 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Rep. James Comer is demanding internal records from the prediction market CEOs, warning that government employees could be using classified information to make “huge profits”.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Polymarket]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Kalshi]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Prediction Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[The agentic CFO in your pocket]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/opinion/2026/05/22/the-agentic-cfo-in-your-pocket</link>\n      <medi