/www.coindesk.com/\">live_news</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[IREN co-founder says AI’s biggest bottleneck is infrastructure, not chips]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/iren-co-founder-says-ai-s-biggest-bottleneck-is-infrastructure-not-chips</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/621a7e00d26515615073001d3c97123324394f4b-1500x1000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">b9a757f7-40a5-41f0-9395-d863735e3c1f</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 13:20:22 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Dan Roberts outlines IREN’s strategy to build a vertically integrated AI platform spanning power, data centers, GPUs and enterprise software.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>James Van Straten</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Mining]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Artificial Intelligence]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[CoinDesk 20 performance update: NEAR surges 19.4% as index trades flat]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/coindesk-indices/2026/05/22/coindesk-20-performance-update-near-surges-19-4-as-index-trades-flat</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/c442204fd3a5075f6614a36be8187fed081c6129-640x480.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">1a0bf55f-12bf-4901-8452-c36179a9956f</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 13:14:46 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Internet Computer (ICP), up 4.3% from Thursday, joined NEAR Protocol (NEAR) as a top performer. ]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>CoinDesk Indices</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/coindesk-indices\"><![CDATA[CoinDesk Indices]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[CoinDesk Indices]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[CoinDesk 20]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[charts]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Prices]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Trump Media moved but 'did not sell' $205 million in bitcoin amid rising losses on crypto bets]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/trump-media-moves-another-usd205m-in-bitcoin-as-losses-on-crypto-bet-swell-to-usd455m</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/e5ea85fd2f228cded77bd633f4ac8a9f9eb4bf0a-6000x4000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">f8509e5c-2703-4a51-87f7-b3df9f8304f5</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 13:08:41 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[DJT’s bitcoin strategy remains under pressure as the company sits on hundreds of millions in unrealized crypto losses and widening quarterly deficits.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Donald Trump]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n<