m</link>\n      <url>https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9ea15d46738b4df64e6e100ab59b373.png</url>\n      <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto entrepreneur Chun Wang joins SpaceX mission to Mars</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:15:39 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:15:39 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/chun-wang-spacex-mars-mission-crypto-entrepreneur</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/chun-wang-spacex-mars-mission-crypto-entrepreneur?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto entrepreneur Chun Wang joins SpaceX mission to Mars\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Chun Wang, who bankrolled and led a SpaceX flight over Earth’s poles, says he will head to Mars on SpaceX’s first manned mission to the red planet.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin ETFs' 6 day loss streak pushes market closer to net outflows for 2026</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:58:35 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:58:35 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflow-streak-pushes-market-closer-to-net-negative-flows-for-2026</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflow-streak-pushes-market-closer-to-net-negative-flows-for-2026?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin ETFs' 6 day loss streak pushes market closer to net outflows for 2026\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Dek: US Bitcoin ETF net inflows have shrunk to $536 million so far in 2026, after recording a six-day run of net outflows totalling $1.55 billion.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>‘TrapDoor’ malware targets crypto dev tools in supply chain attack</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:25:28 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:25:28 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/coordinated-crypto-stealer-campaign-trapdoor-detected-targeting-developers</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/coordinated-crypto-stealer-campaign-trapdoor-detected-targeting-developers?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"‘TrapDoor’ malware targets crypto dev tools in supply chain attack\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Socket says a campaign of malicious packages is aiming to steal crypto and is injecting hidden instructions that hijack popular AI coding assistants.  </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title> ‘Developed ecosystem’ based on crypto has sprung up for AI agents: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:41:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:41:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-agents-using-stablecoins-as-default-settlement-layer-keyrock</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-agents-using-stablecoins-as-default-settlement-layer-keyrock?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" alt=\" ‘Developed ecosystem’ based on crypto has sprung up for AI agents: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Stablecoins became the default settlement layer for AI agents as crypto payment rails can handle sub-dollar transactions more efficiently, says a report from Keyrock.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kalshi backs prediction markets lobby group with former Trump official</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:07:32 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:07:32 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-launches-advocacy-group-to-counter-anti-prediction-market-lobbying</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-launches-advocacy-group-to-counter-anti-prediction-market-lobbying?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kalshi backs prediction markets lobby group with former Trump official\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>\"We’re not going to be outspent or out-organized by entrenched interests protecting their monopolies,\" said John Bivona, head of government relations at Kalshi.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 03:45:13 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 03:45:13 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-postpones-plan-allowing-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-postpones-plan-allowing-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The SEC has reportedly delayed releasing a proposal permitting tokenized stock trading after receiving industry concerns.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Soaring bond prices signal 'structural' shift and Bitcoin 'supercycle': Analyst</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 22:12:55 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 22:12:55 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-bond-prices-structural-shift-bitcoin-supercycle</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-bond-prices-structural-shift-bitcoin-supercycle?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Soaring bond prices signal 'structural' shift and Bitcoin 'supercycle': Analyst\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Fixed-income investors are in a \"panic\" as government securities, once seen as low-risk, begin to crack, according to BitMEX researcher Shang Wu.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:43:42 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:43:42 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The Ethereum Foundation holds less than 1% of all ETH in circulation while other protocol foundations typically hold 10-50% of their native token's supply, the founder said.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[FTX law firm Fenwick & West to pay $54M to victims in settlement]]></title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:05:52 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:05:52 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-54m-ftx-settlement</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-54m-ftx-settlement?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>[... 36819 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":402,"aggregated":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n    <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n    <atom:link href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/rss?_ts=1779703688467&amp;ttl=0\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n    <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    <generator>cointelegraph.com</generator>\n    <lastBuildDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 10:08:09 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en</language>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <im