t.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/gamestop-logo-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/gamestop-logo-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto, Banks, Policy Experts Press Congress to Modernize Bank Secrecy Act</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368763/crypto-banks-policy-experts-press-congress-to-modernize-bank-secrecy-act</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 17:22:33 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A House subcommittee hearing exposed a divide over how far to scale back the 1970-era anti-money laundering law as Trump expands its reach. </description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vismaya V</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368763</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto Is Growing Up—Why Some Everyday Traders Are Moving On</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368746/crypto-growing-up-why-everyday-traders-moving-on</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 16:54:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Muted volatility, political shifts, and Wall Street dominance are driving increasingly jaded retail traders out of crypto.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368746</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/bitcoin-dollar-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Long Reads</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/bitcoin-dollar-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Trump Media Moves Over $200 Million in Bitcoin as Losses Pile Up: Arkham</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368752/trump-media-moves-over-200-million-bitcoin-losses-arkham</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 15:56:52 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>It&#39;s unknown whether Trump Media &amp;#038; Technology Group is selling its Bitcoin, though it has amassed sizable losses on its holdings.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368752</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/donald-trump-bitcoin-statue2-gID_7.jpeg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/donald-trump-bitcoin-statue2-gID_7.jpeg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>NYSE Parent, OKX Counter Hyperliquid With Regulated Oil Perpetual Futures</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368755/nyse-parent-okx-counter-hyperliquid-regulated-oil-perpetual-futures</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 15:15:30 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OKX debuted perpetual oil futures tied to Intercontinental Exchange’s benchmarks, the latest sign of growing competition for Hyperliquid.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368755</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-oil-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-oil-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>House Republicans Open Investigation Into Kalshi, Polymarket Over Insider Trading</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368748/house-republicans-open-investigation-kalshi-polymarket-insider-trades</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 14:37:58 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The chair of the powerful House Oversight Committee has requested documents from Polymarket and Kalshi regarding insider trading and war-related markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368748</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/US-Capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/US-Capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: Mark Cuban Sells His Bitcoin</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368742/morning-minute-mark-cuban-sells-his-bitcoin</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 13:05:45 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The billionaire cited underperformance vs gold and broader disappointment with crypto&#39;s breakout apps (or lack thereof) as drivers.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368742</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-mark-cuban-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-mark-cuban-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Polymarket Hit By ‘Internal Top-Up’ Wallet Exploit, $700K Drained</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368740/polymarket-hit-by-internal-top-up-wallet-exploit-700k-drained</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 12:23:22 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>User funds remain safe after the incident, the prediction market platform said, with contracts and core infrastructure unaffected.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vince Dioquino</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368740</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Hacker1-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>polygon</category>\n    \n      <category>DeFi</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Hacker1-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>NEAR Protocol Jumps 28% on Privacy, AI, and Scaling Upgrades</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368737/near-protocol-jumps-28-on-privacy-ai-and-scaling-upgrades</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 11:30:22 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>NEAR rallied by 45% this week on a series of upgrades positioning it as a potential settlement layer for AI agents and confidential finance.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368737</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-trading-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>near</category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-trading-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Polymarket Taps Jupiter Exec to Lead Japan Push: Report</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368734/polymarket-taps-jupiter-exec-to-lead-japan-push-report</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 10:29:48 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The prediction market has reportedly appointed a representative in Japan as it aims to secure authorization to operate there by 2030.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368734</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/polymarket-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>polygon</category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/polymarket-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Nearly $500B in Bitcoin Is Exposed to Future Quantum Computing Attacks: Glassnode</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368721/nearly-500b-bitcoin-exposed-future-quantum-computing-attacks-glassnode</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 23:00:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Blockchain data firm Glassnode mapped the vulnerabilities embedded in Bitcoin’s existing supply, pointing to exchanges as a weak point.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368721</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bitcoin-crack-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bitcoin-crack-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Prominent Ethereum Dev Proposes $1 Billion ETH Organization With Leader Who &#39;Wants to Fight&#39;</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368694/prominent-ethereum-dev-proposes-1-billion-eth-organization</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 22:08:36 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Former Ethereum Foundation researcher Dankrad Feist appeared to take pointed shots Thursday at ETH co-founder Vitalik Buterin.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368694</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Spotify and Universal Launch AI Remix Tool for Fan-Made Covers</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368710/spotify-universal-ai-remix-tool-fan-made-covers</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 21:56:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Spotify and Universal Music Group say their new licensed AI remix platform will let fans create song covers and remixes while compensating participating artists and songwriters.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368710</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spotify-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spotify-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"719\" width=\"1278\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>DeepSeek Is Building Its Own Claude Code. Beijing Wants the Whole Stack</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368689/deepseek-code-harness-claude-code-alternative-china-ai</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 21:26:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Chinese AI lab already powers coding agents worldwide. Now it wants to own the tool developers use to run them.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368689</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/AI-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/AI-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Young Adults Involved in AI Romance Hide Full Use From Partners 69% of the Time</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368686/young-adults-involved-ai-romance-hide-from-human-partners</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 20:56:20 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Researchers found regular AI companion use among partnered young adults was linked to lower relationship stability and communication quality.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368686</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-12-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-12-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>NHL Agrees to Share Data With the CFTC for Prediction Market Integrity</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368687/nhl-agrees-share-data-cftc-prediction-market-integrity</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 20:21:51 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The agreement ensures the regulator and the NHL communicate and share data to protect the integrity of hockey-related prediction markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368687</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Mark Cuban Says He Sold Most of His Bitcoin</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368678/mark-cuban-sold-most-his-bitcoin</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 19:23:34 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Outspoken billionaire Mark Cuban is disappointed with Bitcoin&#39;s performance, and said he&#39;s parted ways with most of the BTC in his portfolio.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368678</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-mark-cuban-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-mark-cuban-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Proposed ARMA Bill Aims to Enshrine Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Into Law</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368662/proposed-arma-bill-aims-enshrine-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-law</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 18:08:49 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The American Reserve Modernization Act would direct the Treasury to create and maintain a Bitcoin reserve for a minimum of 20 years.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368662</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bitcoin-America-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bitcoin-America-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1687\" width=\"3000\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Trump Halts AI Order Over Fears It Could Hurt US Edge Over China</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368673/trump-halts-ai-order-fears-could-hurt-us-edge-china</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 18:08:32 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Trump said he delayed the order because parts of the proposal risked slowing the U.S. AI industry as competition with China intensifies.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368673</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Trump-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Trump-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ethereum Crypto Influencer Game &#39;Fantasy Top&#39; Shutting Down</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368640/ethereum-crypto-influencer-game-fantasy-top-shutting-down</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 17:49:30 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Fantasy Top, a game that reimagines fantasy sports through the lens of Crypto Twitter, will close down two years after its hot launch.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368640</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-fantasy-top-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Gaming</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-fantasy-top-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Nvidia Beats, Stock Dumps—BofA Says Buy the Dip</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368650/bofa-nvidia-buy-top-pick-350-target</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 17:39:17 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Record $81.6 billion in revenue for Nvidia—and yet the stock fell. Bank of America called the dip noise and raised its price target.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368650</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/nvidia-logo-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/nvidia-logo-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.png\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>US Government Makes $2 Billion Bet on Quantum Computing as Threat to Bitcoin Grows</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368647/us-government-2-billion-bet-quantum-computing-bitcoin-threat-grows</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 17:24:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The U.S. Department of Commerce will invest $2 billion into quantum chip foundries and startups as the &#34;Q-Day&#34; Bitcoin threat nears.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368647</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/quantum-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/quantum-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto Exchange Kraken Secures VARA License to Launch in Dubai</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368643/crypto-exchange-kraken-secures-vara-license-launch-dubai</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 16:32:58 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Dubai&#39;s Virtual Asset Regulatory Authority granted Kraken’s parent company preliminary broker-dealer and investment management authorization.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368643</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/kraken-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/kraken-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>&#39;The Sandbox&#39; Co-Founder&#39;s Wife Targeted in Crypto Kidnapping Attempt: Report</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368631/the-sandbox-co-founders-wife-targeted-in-crypto-kidnapping-attempt-report</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 15:42:21 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>France has become an epicenter of so-called “wrench attacks” targeting crypto executives and their families.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368631</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/sebastien-borget-sandbox-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>the-sandbox</category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/sebastien-borget-sandbox-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1079\" width=\"1918\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto Exchange Blockchain.com Files for IPO in the US</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368608/crypto-exchange-blockchain-com-files-ipo-us</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 14:58:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Long-running crypto exchange Blockchain.com has confidentially filed to take its business public via the U.S. markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368608</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IPOs2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IPOs2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin ATM Firm CoinFlip Blasts &#39;Meritless&#39; Lawsuit as Missouri Demands Restitution for Seniors</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368606/bitcoin-atm-coinflip-blasts-meritless-lawsuit-missouri-restitution-seniors</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 14:43:49 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Missouri&#39;s top prosecutor accused Bitcoin ATM operator CoinFlip of “knowingly facilitating fraudulent transactions.”</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368606</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-bitcoin-atm-cropped-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-bitcoin-atm-cropped